## Install

```sh
pnpm add {{packageName}} @pluxel/runtime
```

Import the plugin constructor into a static catalog or expose the package through a dynamic loader
workspace profile. Both routes use the same plugin class.

```ts
import {{className}} from '{{packageName}}'

export const plugins = [{{className}}]
```

## Develop

```sh
pnpm install
pnpm verify
```

`verify` checks Oxfmt, Oxlint with the Pluxel rule plugin, unused lint suppressions, types, tests, and
the production plugin build. Runtime is a peer dependency; build and test tooling stays in
development dependencies.
